<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Defs>

  <!-- ========================================================================
       RSW_BrainWormPuppet — BRAINWORM_MOD_BUILD_1. The spec's "hostile hive faction
       lens": the host does not change faction, the ENGINE ASKS THE MENTAL STATE who
       it is hostile to (MentalState.ForceHostileTo), and
       MentalState_BrainWormPuppet answers "everyone except the hive's own".

       Shape copied from vanilla BerserkPermanent, read with RimSage rather than
       guessed — maxTicksBeforeRecovery 60000 / minTicksBeforeRecovery 99999999 is
       how vanilla builds a state that ends on its own but is kept alive by a hediff
       restarting it (Verse/Hediff_Scaria.cs). HediffComp_BrainWormPuppeteer is our
       Scaria.

       Two deliberate departures from BerserkPermanent:
         - recoverFromSleep / recoverFromDowned / recoverFromCaptured are all FALSE.
           The hive does not let go because the body slept, fell over, or got tied
           to a bed. Only the cold or a surgeon ends this.
         - allowGuilty FALSE. The host is not responsible for what the parasite does
           with their hands; the colony should not treat them as a criminal for it.

       🔴 The host is ALIVE, always. This state is only ever entered from
       HediffComp_BrainWormPuppeteer, which refuses a dead pawn (owner's permanent
       ruling, 2026-09-11: "Never corpse-walker. Too gross.").
  ======================================================================== -->
  <MentalStateDef ParentName="BaseMentalState">
    <defName>RSW_BrainWormPuppet</defName>
    <label>puppeted</label>
    <stateClass>RimMandrake.StarWars.BrainWorms.MentalState_BrainWormPuppet</stateClass>
    <category>Aggro</category>
    <prisonersCanDo>true</prisonersCanDo>
    <slavesCanDo>true</slavesCanDo>
    <inCaravanCanDo>true</inCaravanCanDo>
    <unspawnedNotInCaravanCanDo>true</unspawnedNotInCaravanCanDo>
    <blockNormalThoughts>true</blockNormalThoughts>
    <blockRandomInteraction>true</blockRandomInteraction>
    <allowGuilty>false</allowGuilty>
    <recoverFromSleep>false</recoverFromSleep>
    <recoverFromDowned>false</recoverFromDowned>
    <recoverFromCaptured>false</recoverFromCaptured>
    <maxTicksBeforeRecovery>60000</maxTicksBeforeRecovery>
    <minTicksBeforeRecovery>99999999</minTicksBeforeRecovery>
    <recoveryMtbDays>0.166</recoveryMtbDays>
    <stateEffecter>Berserk</stateEffecter>
    <nameColor>(0.55, 0.75, 0.35)</nameColor>
    <baseInspectLine>Mental state: Puppeted</baseInspectLine>
    <recoveryMessage>The hive has lost its grip on {0}.</recoveryMessage>
  </MentalStateDef>

</Defs>
